/-!
# Boundary carry loans: `canon760` and `center760` at the 760 layout

Both record converters are renamed copies of `HalfConvert.canonical` /
`HalfConvert.center` on `HalfField.tgt`, under the composite
`endpointMap`, the four endpoint swaps (766↔768, 765↔767, 767↔1026,
1026↔1540), `endpointBorrow` (718↔2409) and the R2 move 760↔772.
`converterLayout760` is that renamed layout; `canon760_eq` / `center760_eq`
identify the record programs with the generic converters on it (checked by
the kernel).  The loaned components lend the 44 exclusive retired sites.
