section Merge_StairDivLoanTop_at_StairSideA

/-!
# Division-endpoint loan, part 3: the window facts for `top760` / the upper sweep (LT15)

Shapes as requested in `StairBoundaryLoanDecoderNeeds.lean` (LT8): `d = 44`,
`layers = tailL`, `top = top760`, `ys = (xs ++ [cin]).drop 11`, `cs = cs.drop 11`,
`cin = cs.getD 10 0`, `U = emitSweep (tailL.drop 45) top760`.

* (a) static: `top760_avoids_hosts`, `upper_avoids_hosts`.
* (b) UNCONDITIONAL (any state, any record): `top760_preserves_loan_bits`,
  `upper_same_all` (only `X` gates target those wires, each an even number of
  times), `upper_roles_zero_all` (the last write on every retired role inside
  `U` is its erase measurement).
* (c) record independence on the reachable states: `upper_tapeFree`,
  `window_tapeFree`, from record independence of the unloaned program
  `cellDecoderSweep` (= `cellDecoderLoan` with `window760 0`), which follows from
  `cellDecoderNext_tapeFree` (the record's `cellDecoderNext_correct`) plus LT8's
  part 1 (`sweepFree_of_part1`).
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 100000
set_option maxHeartbeats 8000000
set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false

namespace ECDSAAdd.Entrant.CompareDecoder.BoundaryLoan

