/-!
# LT21: per-row-pair site facts for the forward-segment spec

All facts are finite list checks (`decide +kernel`) for the five row pairs
`(87,62) (62,47) (47,32) (32,22) (22,12)`.
-/

section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 30000
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxSize 4096
